WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.440 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.640 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.930 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.400 --> 01:04.400
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.890 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:33.570 --> 01:34.570
We're home!

01:35.570 --> 01:38.100
Welcome home, Vanilla-chama.

01:38.100 --> 01:39.340
I'm back, Blanca.

01:40.470 --> 01:44.840
There's a package for you from
Queen Candy, Vanilla-chama.

01:45.180 --> 01:45.880
From Mom?

01:46.540 --> 01:48.380
Ooh! Bone candy!

01:49.250 --> 01:50.080
That's nice ...

01:50.680 --> 01:54.750
Just like Queen Candy to be so kind.

01:55.150 --> 01:57.880
She was like that as a
Queen Candidate as well.

01:58.160 --> 02:00.800
Totally different from
Chocolat's mom, Cinnamon.

02:01.290 --> 02:03.660
Huh? You know about my mom, Blanca?

02:04.400 --> 02:07.600
Hey wait, that makes you, like, really old.

02:07.830 --> 02:08.600
OLD?

02:08.970 --> 02:10.440
It's rude to talk about a lady's age!

02:10.940 --> 02:13.770
You're just as much of a
jerk as your mother was!

02:14.230 --> 02:15.710
My mom wasn't a jerk!

02:16.040 --> 02:21.870
Yes, she was. Since she was so beautiful and
popular, she just did whatever she wanted.

02:22.280 --> 02:24.870
Sly and cunning, always manipulating
other people to do things for her.

02:25.120 --> 02:26.680
Don't just say whatever you want!

02:26.680 --> 02:27.370
I'll whup your butt!

02:29.220 --> 02:31.460
But it's all true!

02:30.820 --> 02:31.460
Liar!

02:32.120 --> 02:33.660
True, all true!

02:33.990 --> 02:36.330
You don't know anything, Chocolat.

02:38.660 --> 02:39.330
Duke!

02:39.930 --> 02:44.140
Tell me about my mom! If Blanca
knows about her, you should too.

02:44.840 --> 02:46.600
Well, she was famous.

02:46.970 --> 02:50.110
She was amazingly beautiful,
and really popular with guys.

02:50.110 --> 02:52.180
Not THAT, about her personality and stuff...

02:52.610 --> 02:54.550
I don't know about that...

02:54.950 --> 02:57.920
But I'm sure it's just like your
personality, totally awf--

03:00.790 --> 03:04.660
Fine then. I'll go back to the Magical World,
and find out about my mom myself!

03:06.220 --> 03:08.660
Chocolat is disqualified
as a Queen Candidate?!

03:12.600 --> 03:15.230
Robin's got to know a way to
return to the Magical World.

03:19.070 --> 03:22.410
Is he out? And just when I need him...

03:24.040 --> 03:27.450
It's open! Pardon me...

03:28.250 --> 03:31.480
Even if Robin's gone, there's got to be some
way to get to the Magical World.

03:34.450 --> 03:36.770
But man, what a house!

03:39.660 --> 03:40.790
Phew, that scared me.

03:41.330 --> 03:42.030
Just a statue?

03:42.990 --> 03:44.030
Who are you?

03:46.260 --> 03:48.650
Over here, over here. Where are you looking?

03:48.930 --> 03:50.140
The mirror?

03:50.770 --> 03:53.370
I am the master of this house, Ravissement.

03:53.770 --> 03:54.710
Ravissement?

03:55.110 --> 03:57.280
Despite having "man" in
my name, I'm not a guy.

03:57.980 --> 04:00.180
So you're the slow-witted
Queen Candidate, eh?

04:01.010 --> 04:04.380
That's what Robin is always reporting
to the Magical World, so I know.

04:05.820 --> 04:08.750
I want to whup its butt...
but for now I'll let it slide.

04:09.020 --> 04:11.450
Ah! I've heard of you too!

04:11.450 --> 04:15.630
About the amazingly knowledgeable,
super pretty mirror.

04:18.760 --> 04:21.050
But you see, even if you are Ravissement,

04:21.050 --> 04:23.360
you probably wouldn't know
how to get to the Magical World.

04:23.570 --> 04:28.810
Oh, I know that. Just open the door
in the dark side of the moon.

04:30.110 --> 04:31.440
The dark side of the moon?

04:34.480 --> 04:35.510
Oh, I see.

04:36.210 --> 04:38.780
But you normally couldn't
fly that high, you know...

04:41.090 --> 04:44.060
You can use a reflection in a mirror,
just like me, you see.

04:46.090 --> 04:48.230
Thank you, Ms. Big Mouth Mirror.

04:51.830 --> 04:53.130
Sugar Sugar Rune!

04:53.130 --> 04:54.230
Choco Rune!

04:57.840 --> 04:59.400
Open, door in the moon!

04:59.940 --> 05:00.970
Kyahoo!

05:01.640 --> 05:02.970
Hey, wait...

05:05.640 --> 05:07.580
Oh, I see. It works like this.

05:08.750 --> 05:10.180
I've come back to the Magical World!

05:10.550 --> 05:12.780
In the Magical World I can do anything!

05:12.780 --> 05:14.390
It's been so long since I could fly!

05:16.220 --> 05:20.730
The orange moon, the pale purple
sky, the pink clouds, sweet air.

05:21.830 --> 05:23.210
I'm back, my royaume.

05:24.730 --> 05:27.570
I'm back, purple city, Ville Violet!

05:41.510 --> 05:42.250
It comes.

05:46.150 --> 05:47.420
What is it, Houx?

05:48.250 --> 05:49.820
The fire fortune-telling is saying this:

05:50.390 --> 05:54.560
A rogue with a carefree soul
and green eyes is coming.

05:56.130 --> 05:58.700
Is someone aiming for our twin forest?!

05:58.700 --> 05:59.860
Calm down, Saule.

06:01.600 --> 06:04.210
If you're talking about a green-eyed rogue...

06:04.740 --> 06:05.300
It couldn't be!

06:05.870 --> 06:07.240
Yup, Saule!

06:08.770 --> 06:10.480
I'm back! Yay!

06:11.810 --> 06:13.240
Chocolat! It's been a while.

06:13.750 --> 06:14.950
You look good, Chocolat!

06:16.780 --> 06:20.320
Oh, I see. You came back to
find out about your mother.

06:21.050 --> 06:23.450
Then shouldn't you just ask your old man?

06:23.990 --> 06:24.960
Asking Gramps is no good.

06:25.320 --> 06:28.060
I've asked him a ton and
he's never told me squat.

06:28.630 --> 06:30.630
Then maybe asking your mother's friends?

06:31.460 --> 06:33.700
I don't know any of my mom's friends.

06:34.230 --> 06:38.040
Ah! Since they were Queen Candidates
together, maybe Queen Candy?

06:40.070 --> 06:43.010
You aren't planning to just go and
suddenly ask the Queen, are you?

06:43.940 --> 06:45.140
I'll take the chance.

06:45.710 --> 06:46.910
I'm going to ask the Queen!

06:48.310 --> 06:49.650
No, don't, Chocolat!

06:50.280 --> 06:53.950
No matter how long you and Vanilla have
been friends, you can't just do that!

06:54.450 --> 06:57.660
We're talking about the Queen
here! Her Majesty, the Queen!

06:58.280 --> 06:58.920
But...

06:59.560 --> 07:01.230
Don't you have any other clues?

07:02.430 --> 07:06.360
Oh yeah, my mom went to Ecole
de Centre, just like we did!

07:06.630 --> 07:07.600
That's it.

07:08.970 --> 07:12.540
If we find the yearbook, we could figure
out who her old classmates were.

07:12.970 --> 07:17.280
I see! In the yearbook there should
be an old picture of my mom!

07:17.810 --> 07:19.910
Yup. It should be in the library.

07:20.410 --> 07:21.350
Okay, let's go.

07:21.680 --> 07:22.010
Right!

07:25.580 --> 07:28.520
Ah, flying around with you guys is the best!

07:29.350 --> 07:32.020
When all three of us are together, we
ain't afraid of nothin', you know!

07:32.420 --> 07:32.890
Yeah.

07:35.160 --> 07:37.360
It's Ecole de Centre. Just like old times.

07:37.760 --> 07:41.870
Hey, Chocolat, getting lots of
hearts in the Human World?

07:42.300 --> 07:45.000
Huh? Uh... sure, I guess so.

07:45.600 --> 07:48.310
If you become Queen, let's get married!

07:48.970 --> 07:50.580
I'm gonna be the King!

07:50.580 --> 07:53.510
Hey, Chocolat's going to marry me!

07:53.510 --> 07:55.110
What'd you say, you little...

07:55.680 --> 07:56.710
Same to you!

07:57.450 --> 07:58.950
Watch it, you two.

07:59.820 --> 08:00.720
Cut it...

08:01.790 --> 08:03.290
Just cut it out!

08:18.870 --> 08:19.300
Oh crap!

08:19.800 --> 08:21.040
We've got to get out of
here or we'll be caught!

08:21.510 --> 08:23.310
No! We're searching for the yearbook.

08:24.280 --> 08:25.280
Chocolat...

08:25.280 --> 08:26.020
Just give it up!

08:26.310 --> 08:27.110
No way!

08:28.880 --> 08:29.610
Who are you?

08:29.980 --> 08:31.750
Trying to break in through the roof?

08:33.180 --> 08:35.120
Uh, well this is not...

08:36.920 --> 08:37.920
That pendant...

08:38.320 --> 08:40.990
Aren't you Chocolat Meilleure,
the Queen Candidate?

08:41.960 --> 08:44.660
That's right. And we're together with her.

08:45.600 --> 08:46.360
This is bad!

08:46.730 --> 08:48.600
I've got to contact the
head of the Palais guards!

08:49.730 --> 08:50.300
What the --?

08:51.140 --> 08:52.040
What's he talking about?

08:52.670 --> 08:55.170
Looks like you're the only one
that's done something wrong.

08:55.170 --> 08:56.610
I've got a bad feeling about this.

08:57.440 --> 08:58.340
Let's get out of here, Chocolat.

08:58.780 --> 08:59.350
Don't move!

09:01.510 --> 09:02.310
What's this?!

09:02.780 --> 09:03.410
Saule!

09:08.790 --> 09:11.020
You really are Chocolat
Meilleure, aren't you?

09:13.520 --> 09:17.560
I am the captain of the
palais guards, Gracier.

09:18.460 --> 09:21.800
Does Examiner Robin know
that you've come here?

09:21.800 --> 09:26.320
Um, no. I kinda came here secretly.

09:27.470 --> 09:30.650
It is forbidden for a Queen Candidate
to come to the Magical World

09:30.650 --> 09:32.340
without the permission of the examiner.

09:32.640 --> 09:32.910
Huh?

09:35.210 --> 09:37.980
Escort Chocolat Meilleure to the palais!

09:37.980 --> 09:38.550
Yessir!

09:39.080 --> 09:39.820
Chocolat!

09:40.250 --> 09:42.350
You guys can stay right there.

09:43.180 --> 09:43.790
Dammit!

09:49.230 --> 09:51.860
Um, what's gonna happen to me?

09:52.400 --> 09:55.670
In the worst case, you'll be disqualified
from being a Queen Candidate.

09:56.130 --> 09:56.900
Huh?!

09:57.400 --> 10:02.770
The Senate will have an examination
hearing. It will all be decided there.

10:03.140 --> 10:05.950
Oh no! Disqualified from being
a Queen Candidate...

10:06.610 --> 10:08.010
What am I going to do?

10:21.830 --> 10:22.860
Chocolat-chan!

10:22.860 --> 10:23.960
Chocolat!

10:25.230 --> 10:26.260
She's not here...

10:26.800 --> 10:28.730
Where could she have wandered off to?

10:29.000 --> 10:31.100
Just let her be.

10:31.100 --> 10:33.670
Let's have dinner already, Vanilla-chama.

10:34.140 --> 10:34.710
But --

10:36.840 --> 10:37.440
Vanilla.

10:38.010 --> 10:40.180
Robin-sensei, Chocolat has...

10:40.850 --> 10:43.180
I got a call from the Magical World Senate.

10:43.950 --> 10:46.950
That damned Chocolat just went back
to the Magical World on her own.

10:47.350 --> 10:50.150
Huh? But you said to never, never do that!

10:50.820 --> 10:53.670
Knowing her, she probably wasn't listening.

10:53.860 --> 10:55.990
It's possible for her!

10:55.990 --> 10:58.360
Ah! She's gonna be disqualified!

10:58.360 --> 10:59.720
What should I do?!

11:01.930 --> 11:06.970
Finally! With Chocolat disqualified, the
next Queen will be Vanilla-chama!

11:07.540 --> 11:08.910
Blanca, stop it.

11:09.640 --> 11:12.240
Robin-sensei, I'm sure that Chocolat
went back to the Magical World

11:12.240 --> 11:14.230
because she wanted to find out about her mom.

11:14.610 --> 11:17.680
Chocolat's mom? About Cinnamon?

11:18.520 --> 11:19.740
No matter the reason,

11:19.740 --> 11:24.110
if you go back to the Magical World without the permission of the examiner,

11:24.110 --> 11:26.240
that's not good.

11:26.890 --> 11:30.090
Robin-sensei, please save Chocolat-chan!

11:30.830 --> 11:34.230
I'll be going to the Senate's hearing now.

11:34.730 --> 11:35.800
I'll go too!

11:36.130 --> 11:37.600
Please take me to the Magical World!

11:37.940 --> 11:41.110
No! Just wait here patiently.

11:48.010 --> 11:48.880
Chocolat-chan...

12:05.230 --> 12:08.370
First, I'll keep your wand and pendant.

12:09.330 --> 12:12.370
Am I really going to be disqualified
from being a Queen Candidate?

12:13.340 --> 12:15.910
Everything will be decided at the hearing.

12:22.150 --> 12:27.250
Mom, I'm sorry. Even though I said I'd
become the Queen you couldn't be...

12:28.390 --> 12:30.520
It's not looking so good right now.

12:35.730 --> 12:36.530
Gramps!

12:37.360 --> 12:39.200
What're you doin' returning
to the Magical World?!

12:39.700 --> 12:41.030
Oww!

12:41.630 --> 12:44.100
Stop it, Gramps!

12:44.100 --> 12:45.700
What? Stop?

12:46.200 --> 12:47.540
Please stop it, Corne-san.

12:48.170 --> 12:50.910
We have to prepare for the Senate hearing.

12:53.980 --> 12:55.650
Chocolat Meilleure, this way.

12:56.910 --> 12:57.380
Okay.

13:01.950 --> 13:03.650
And now, we will open the hearing

13:03.650 --> 13:08.630
on whether to disqualify Chocolat Meilleure
due to her violation of the rules.

13:09.660 --> 13:10.960
Chocolat Meilleure.

13:10.960 --> 13:11.890
Yes?

13:12.230 --> 13:14.070
Why did you break the rules?

13:14.400 --> 13:18.670
Rules? Um, I think I've heard them, but...

13:19.200 --> 13:20.970
Sorry, I forgot!

13:21.410 --> 13:22.970
How careless!

13:26.210 --> 13:28.210
Chairman, I'd like to make a remark!

13:28.910 --> 13:29.910
Robin!

13:31.020 --> 13:32.880
You may, Examiner Robin.

13:34.050 --> 13:38.120
Members of the Senate, do not blame Chocolat!

13:38.530 --> 13:43.290
It is all the fault of I, the examiner.

13:43.290 --> 13:45.630
It is because I failed to
explain the rules properly!

13:46.730 --> 13:48.100
Robin, you're so kind...

13:48.500 --> 13:50.100
However, Examiner Robin...

13:51.740 --> 13:55.000
The other person you gave the same
explanation of the rules to,

13:55.000 --> 13:57.880
Vanilla Mieux, did not break them.

13:58.540 --> 13:59.880
Which means...

13:59.880 --> 14:04.480
That the true person at fault is
actually Chocolat Meilleure.

14:04.980 --> 14:07.150
Yup, I guess so.

14:07.150 --> 14:07.990
Robin!

14:08.690 --> 14:10.120
I wish to make a remark.

14:11.420 --> 14:13.490
You may, Queen Candy.

14:14.490 --> 14:16.690
According to the examiner's report,

14:16.690 --> 14:20.530
it gives a summary of the Queen Candidates'
progress in the Human World.

14:20.530 --> 14:23.530
They've begun to collect hearts favorably.

14:24.200 --> 14:28.840
Wouldn't it be regrettable to disqualify
one of the candidates just now?

14:29.510 --> 14:30.840
Queen Candy...

14:32.040 --> 14:37.010
If I may, there are plenty of other Queen
Candidates we could choose.

14:37.340 --> 14:38.680
Yes.

14:38.680 --> 14:43.480
Weren't you against having Chocolat
be a candidate from the start?

14:44.050 --> 14:50.160
In any case, if you can't follow the rules,
there's no way you could serve as Queen.

14:50.590 --> 14:55.470
And she immediately broke into a building,
there's really no other option.

14:56.000 --> 14:59.400
Therefore, we will immediately disqualify --

14:59.400 --> 15:00.540
No!

15:01.040 --> 15:03.070
Then . . . disqualify me too!

15:06.680 --> 15:07.410
Vanilla!

15:08.780 --> 15:10.680
I've also come...

15:11.280 --> 15:13.020
without Robin-sensei's permission!

15:14.080 --> 15:15.520
Oh my God!

15:15.990 --> 15:17.760
What are we supposed to do now?!

15:17.760 --> 15:20.490
Both of the Queen Candidates
have broken the rules...

15:20.890 --> 15:23.090
It's unprecedented!

15:25.500 --> 15:27.570
Vanilla, why did you do this?

15:28.130 --> 15:30.300
It's all my fault.

15:30.300 --> 15:35.660
When Blanca was bad-mouthing
your mom, I couldn't stop her.

15:37.040 --> 15:40.080
If I had stopped her, you wouldn't
have come back...

15:40.980 --> 15:42.380
It's all my fault!

15:42.750 --> 15:44.080
No it's not, Vanilla!

15:44.450 --> 15:45.880
I'm the one to blame!

15:47.250 --> 15:51.890
Members of the Senate, Chocolat-chan just
wanted to find out about her mother.

15:52.460 --> 15:54.430
Please don't disqualify her!

15:54.430 --> 15:59.130
Vanilla broke the rules for my sake.
I'm the only one to blame.

16:02.330 --> 16:04.270
Chocolat, Vanilla...

16:07.040 --> 16:09.110
Order! Order!

16:09.940 --> 16:12.800
Now the members of the Queen Selection Committee

16:12.800 --> 16:15.110
will recess to another room to debate.

16:21.350 --> 16:23.050
I wonder what's going to happen to us?

16:23.450 --> 16:26.220
I don't want you to be
disqualified too, Vanilla.

16:26.620 --> 16:32.730
That's fine. Even though I was scared, I went to the Human World because we were together.

16:33.530 --> 16:37.400
If you were to get disqualified,
I'd want to be disqualified too.

16:38.800 --> 16:40.740
Thanks, Vanilla.

16:42.840 --> 16:46.710
I used to think that saying
"thank you" was lame,

16:47.510 --> 16:50.390
but now I don't care if it is. I'm
just gonna say what I feel.

16:51.480 --> 16:55.490
When you came for me,
I was really happy.

16:56.220 --> 16:57.390
Chocolat-chan...

17:03.890 --> 17:05.460
Both of you, this way.

17:07.160 --> 17:09.030
These are the results of our deliberation.

17:12.100 --> 17:15.340
Chocolat Meilleure, Vanilla Mieux...

17:15.340 --> 17:18.510
Both of the Queen Candidates
are disqualified!

17:24.750 --> 17:27.120
And now to continue on...

17:27.120 --> 17:30.890
We must confer as to who to choose
as new Queen Candidates.

17:30.890 --> 17:33.190
No, that will be unnecessary.

17:34.190 --> 17:35.200
From now on,

17:35.200 --> 17:36.830
the new Queen Candidates will be...

17:37.460 --> 17:39.200
the two here, Vanilla Mieux...

17:39.760 --> 17:41.830
and Chocolat Meilleure.

17:43.400 --> 17:44.840
But that's --

17:45.200 --> 17:48.110
It's true that they broke the rules,

17:48.110 --> 17:51.010
and therefore they must be
disqualified from being candidates.

17:51.340 --> 17:55.780
However, to go as far as you did with
your actions for each other...

17:56.180 --> 17:59.970
We could not think of anyone more
suited to be Queen Candidates.

18:01.390 --> 18:03.050
I also think so.

18:03.520 --> 18:04.930
Queen Candy...

18:05.660 --> 18:09.190
Having made mistakes, the courage
to stand up against things.

18:09.960 --> 18:13.730
Sacrificing oneself, trying to save
your friend with no regrets.

18:14.870 --> 18:19.700
Isn't that a very important
part of being a Queen?

18:23.540 --> 18:25.740
If the Queen says so...

18:26.440 --> 18:28.750
Then the Queen selection
committee has decided

18:28.750 --> 18:33.820
that the new Queen Candidates will be
Chocolat Meilleure and Vanilla Mieux.

18:35.790 --> 18:39.920
Captain Gracier, please return
their pendants and wands.

18:39.920 --> 18:40.600
Yes, your majesty.

18:40.600 --> 18:42.560
Thank goodness!

18:55.770 --> 18:56.640
Alright!

19:05.280 --> 19:05.820
Vanilla!

19:06.150 --> 19:06.880
Chocolat-chan!

19:07.790 --> 19:08.790
We did it!

19:12.990 --> 19:16.390
Congratulations, Vanilla, Chocolat.

19:17.160 --> 19:18.200
Thank you, Mama.

19:18.630 --> 19:19.830
Thank you very much.

19:20.730 --> 19:23.570
Um... excuse me, but...

19:24.030 --> 19:25.900
The reason I broke the rules was...

19:26.540 --> 19:29.310
Because you wanted to find out
about Cinnamon, correct?

19:29.310 --> 19:29.930
Yes.

19:31.180 --> 19:33.540
Cinnamon was a very incredible woman.

19:34.650 --> 19:36.680
Incredible passion, and a strong will.

19:37.550 --> 19:41.450
She really understood people's feelings,
and was a kind person.

19:43.190 --> 19:45.160
My mom was a wonderful person, after all...

19:45.790 --> 19:47.660
It makes me kinda happy.

19:47.930 --> 19:48.630
Oh yes!

19:49.090 --> 19:56.330
It seems Blanca got the wrong idea, but the
bone candy was meant for both of you.

19:57.500 --> 20:00.900
If Cinnamon had become Queen, I'm
sure she would have done the same.

20:01.770 --> 20:08.970
I would know. Even though our personalities
were opposite, we were best of friends.

20:09.750 --> 20:12.080
Very much like how you two are now.

20:13.120 --> 20:13.650
That's right.

20:14.650 --> 20:15.920
This is for you.

20:18.690 --> 20:20.020
It's Cinnamon's journal.

20:20.590 --> 20:21.400
My mom's?

20:22.130 --> 20:26.330
She told me to give this
to you when you'd grown.

20:27.460 --> 20:29.470
Huh? There's a lock?

20:31.940 --> 20:32.540
Gramps.

20:33.200 --> 20:35.340
There's never been a key.

20:35.340 --> 20:37.910
Then we can't read it!

20:38.310 --> 20:40.510
The key doesn't exist.

20:41.150 --> 20:43.210
I got it! I'll just open it with magic.

20:43.710 --> 20:46.720
Nope, you can't open it only
with the power of magic.

20:47.050 --> 20:48.520
Then how?!

20:50.490 --> 20:54.530
The way you just got mad at the journal...
it reminds me of Cinnamon.

20:55.760 --> 20:58.150
Was my mom some kind of weirdo?

20:58.400 --> 21:00.230
Okay, time to go.

21:00.860 --> 21:03.230
If you stay in the magical world any longer,

21:03.600 --> 21:05.540
you'll get disqualified again!

21:07.240 --> 21:10.310
Hey, Vanilla, let's stop
by the portrait gallery!

21:10.310 --> 21:12.380
Chocolat-chan, we've got
to go straight back...

21:12.980 --> 21:14.880
I've got a picture I want to look at.

21:23.620 --> 21:25.490
Yup, it's the spitting image of Pierre.

21:26.160 --> 21:27.320
Who's the picture of?

21:27.820 --> 21:30.090
The Ice Prince, Glace.

21:31.090 --> 21:32.430
A long long time ago,

21:32.430 --> 21:36.020
out of the seven people who
created the Magical World,

21:36.020 --> 21:38.100
he was the only one who was male.

21:39.240 --> 21:42.820
Chocolat-chan, why did you
want to see this picture?

21:44.780 --> 21:47.580
Chocolat-chan, you really do like Pierre...

21:53.150 --> 21:55.150
Good for you, Chocolat, Vanilla!

21:55.590 --> 21:57.080
Do your best in the Human World again!

21:57.750 --> 21:58.420
Sure!

21:58.420 --> 21:59.090
Thanks!

22:02.960 --> 22:04.330
We promised, Vanilla...

22:04.900 --> 22:05.960
Whichever one of us wins...

22:06.500 --> 22:08.200
Whoever becomes Queen...

22:10.100 --> 22:12.200
We'll be best friends forever!

22:23.080 --> 22:29.390
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.520 --> 22:30.890
"Love"

22:31.830 --> 22:35.330
A magic spell.

22:37.500 --> 22:44.770
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.200 --> 22:54.280
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.950 --> 23:00.220
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.820 --> 23:03.890
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.190 --> 23:11.260
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.630 --> 23:16.070
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.070 --> 23:26.180
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.240 --> 23:35.090
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:45.970 --> 23:47.210
The summer ocean!

23:47.210 --> 23:50.250
When it comes to cute swimsuits, the beach has a monopoly!

23:50.970 --> 23:53.410
I'll get Pierre's heart today, for sure!

23:54.440 --> 23:57.020
But those members that came with us are getting in the way.

23:57.790 --> 24:00.210
I've got to get alone together with Pierre somehow...

24:01.040 --> 24:03.620
Fortune-telling book, tell me a good way!

24:04.460 --> 24:06.050
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:06.640 --> 24:08.830
A Lady's Vacances Date

24:09.530 --> 24:13.630
Little boy, I shall teach you the ways of adult love.
